# ==============================================================================
# Test: 02_meshing_hexa_sweep / test_hex_sweep_revolve.fbl
# Description: Rotational sweep to create an axisymmetric hollow cylinder with hex elements
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Planar rectangular cross-section in X-Z plane (radius R_inner=10, R_outer=15, height=20)
pnt p1 10.0 0.0 0.0
pnt p2 15.0 0.0 0.0
pnt p3 15.0 0.0 20.0
pnt p4 10.0 0.0 20.0

line l1 p1 p2 4
line l2 p2 p3 8
line l3 p3 p4 4
line l4 p4 p1 8

gsur s1 + BLEND + l1 + l2 + l3 + l4

# 2. Put surface in set and sweep 90 degrees around Z axis in 6 segments
seta base s s1
pnt pz1 0.0 0.0 0.0
pnt pz2 0.0 0.0 1.0
swep base top rot pz1 pz2 90.0 6 a

# 3. Mesh with quadratic hex elements (he20)
elty all he20
mesh all

# 4. Export mesh
send all abq

prnt se all

quit
